    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="F_hctz_abs" name="fraction absorbed hydrochlorothiazide" value="0.7" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Fraction absorbed, i.e., only a fraction of the hydrochlorothiazide in the intestinal lumen
is absorbed. This parameter determines how much of the hydrochlorothiazide is excreted.</p>
            <p>
              <code>F_hctz_abs</code> of dose is absorbed. <code>(1-F_hctz_abs)</code> is excreted in feces.</p>
              <p>around 11-25% of dose recovered in feces {Beermann1976}
around 60-70 percent urinary recovery of oral dose
~70-80 percent urinary recovery of oral dose [Barbhaiya1982]
~70 percent after oral dose, ~93% IV dose [Beermann1976]</p>
            </body>
          </notes>
      </parameter>
